<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Skills</h1>
<p>Skills are what you have learned to do: open a lock, rescue a friend, hide, 
track, or make the evil skeletons go away. Your guild teaches them (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a> and <a cmd='#'>Help Info</a>), and how good you get depends on your race, 
your profession and your abilities. Some skills are commands of their own, 
like backstab or hide; others are used by themselves when you do something, 
like climb or swimming.
</p><p>These are the skills of Valhalla. Click one to read its help:
</p><p><a cmd='#'>help ambush</a>, <a cmd='#'>help appraisal</a>, armor chain, armor hard leather, armor plate,
armor soft leather, <a cmd='#'>help backstab</a>, <a cmd='#'>help bash</a>, <a cmd='#'>help berserk</a>,
<a cmd='#'>help butcher</a>, <a cmd='#'>help charge</a>, <a cmd='#'>help cleave</a>, <a cmd='#'>help climb</a>, <a cmd='#'>help consider</a>,
<a cmd='#'>help cook</a>, <a cmd='#'>help curare</a>, <a cmd='#'>help defend</a>, <a cmd='#'>help diagnostics</a>,
<a cmd='#'>help disarming</a>, <a cmd='#'>help dowse</a>, <a cmd='#'>help elbow</a>, evaluating,
<a cmd='#'>help fashion weapon</a>, <a cmd='#'>help filching</a>, <a cmd='#'>help first aid</a>, <a cmd='#'>help fleeing</a>,
<a cmd='#'>help forage</a>, hand cuffing, <a cmd='#'>help herbs</a>, <a cmd='#'>help hide</a>, <a cmd='#'>help hit</a>,
<a cmd='#'>help hunt</a>, <a cmd='#'>help kick</a>, <a cmd='#'>help knee</a>, <a cmd='#'>help lay trap</a>, leadership,
<a cmd='#'>help leap</a>, <a cmd='#'>help palm</a>, <a cmd='#'>help peeking</a>, <a cmd='#'>help pick lock</a>,
